id: bloodstained-accessory
name: Bloodstained Accessory
kind: gear
itemType: accessory
# A Special Accessory: it follows the rules for Special Basic Items - no Craft DC, and the
# ARC hands it out.
special: true
# "If you enter the Raging State, you may enter the Determined State until the end of your
# turn. This effect can only be used once for this Accessory."
entersOnFrom: raging
entersOnState: determined
entersOnUntil: end
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Steadfast Checks 1 higher, Morale 1(bT) higher, Wound Rolls 1(T) higher while Raging - and
  once, Determined until the end of your turn on entering Raging.
text: >
  Bloodstained Accessory: A piece of cloth or keepsake stained with the blood of a fallen
  comrade used to remind you what you’re fighting for.
  –Effects: This Accessory has multiple effects that apply while it is equipped:

  * Increase the Dice Score of your Steadfast Checks by 1.
  * Increase your Morale Saves by 1(bT).
  * While in the Raging State, increase your Wound Rolls by 1(T).
  * If you enter the Raging State, you may enter the Determined State until the end of your
    turn. This effect can only be used once for this Accessory.

  When an Ally dies, you may take an Accessory they possess or tear off a piece of their
  Apparel by spending 2 Actions beside them. If you do, that Accessory or piece of Apparel
  becomes a Bloodstained Accessory.

---

# --- What the system does ---------------------------------------------------------------------
#
# While worn, the three below. And on entering Raging, whoever entered it is asked whether to
# enter Determined until the end of their turn; taken, it is used up for this Accessory - its
# own clock ends it at the end of the turn, so Determined's usual skipped turn never comes.
#
# --- What the table keeps ----------------------------------------------------------------------
#
# Making one: the Ally's death, the 2 Actions beside them, and which Accessory or Apparel it
# was. It is given through Add Item, and can be renamed for what it was - "Bloodstained Scarf".
[passive]
steadfast.dice += 1;
save.morale += 1(bT);
if (inState("raging")) {
  wound += 1(T);
}
